{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20% of players spent over 1 hour in the demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Despite being only about 10 minutes long, it\u2019s an action game built for replayability.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e366a0d48f467fd43b1d873d7aa36b42.poster.avif?t=1774399702\" width=202 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e366a0d48f467fd43b1d873d7aa36b42.webm?t=1774399702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e366a0d48f467fd43b1d873d7aa36b42.mp4?t=1774399702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No-damage runs, speedruns, low-flap challenges \u2014 designed for players who love mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full version includes:<br>\u30fbTrue Ending<br>\u30fbGallery unlocked through score achievements<br>\u30fbHighest difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who played the demo and challenged it with speedruns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Releasing April 8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20% off</strong> during the first week</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300cAction games are so fun, aren't they?\u300d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful world,<br>a deep story,<br>imaginative flavor text...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Instead of all that,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I made this game so even people who don\u2019t usually play action games can feel that it\u2019s <i>fun</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special moves of the main character:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Glide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spread your wings and glide. The floaty feeling of flying far might get you hooked?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.poster.avif?t=1774399702\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.webm?t=1774399702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/e9c2c88bf157cf9ca436a6155bb9525a.mp4?t=1774399702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Super Dash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you keep running on the ground, the faster you go. It makes the glide even more powerful\u2014guaranteed to feel great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.poster.avif?t=1774399702\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.webm?t=1774399702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/99c3f468e4cda2381e644f5ea8ec8e2e.mp4?t=1774399702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 <strong>Wall Bounce Glide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use walls, one of the obstacles, to your advantage. It\u2019s tricky, but if you can pull it off... it\u2019s a blast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.poster.avif?t=1774399702\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.webm?t=1774399702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/extras/7b49fa18ec5ab52055261d4dbea7c1b3.mp4?t=1774399702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754530?t=1774399702","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754530?t=1774399702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/270dd141e6121c5f1b7a6d0d6a9337b9366796ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774399702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754530/270dd141e6121c5f1b7a6d0d6a9337b9366796ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774399702","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3956830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20% of players spent over 1 hour in the demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Despite being only about 10 minutes long, it\u2019s an action game built for replayability.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla